why Every Horde quest of the Excavation Site in one run, lead-in included.

# The Excavation Site's Horde quests in one guide: the pick-ups in
# Orgrimmar and Hammerfall, the Deathstalker Agent above the Dragonmaw camp,
# one run through the dungeon, then the hand-ins. Steps already done are
# passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chain: Borstan's 95697 Changing Tastes (Thicket Raptor Meat); Zaruk's
# 95663 Dragonmaw Rumors -> the Deathstalker Agent's 95682 Open the Maw
# (Dragonmaw Saboteurs and Warders, the Dragonmaw Dispatch). Inside, the
# Relic Guardian's Titan Relic (item 270866) starts 95664 Elder Knowledge, for
# Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff, who gives 98823 Earthen Echo, for Muln
# Earthfury in Mulgore.
#
# Left out: nothing of the Horde's.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places anything inside, so the goals stand at
# the door (@47.8,56.2) with `group 5`. The steps follow a run of my own:
# Saltspine, the raptors and Shadetooth, the Dragonmaw, then the Relic
# Guardian. Every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a group that
# takes them in another order still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items and rewards: Polestar's reference data (data/forever,
#   built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's Codex page for
#   the dungeon.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - A run of my own on 2026-11-12 (Horde, five players, level 33), recorded
#   with Polestar's recorder and shared with Polestar Client: Saltspine,
#   then the Thicket raptors (the meat from Thicket Hunters and Lurkers) and
#   Shadetooth, then the Dragonmaw (the Dispatch from a Dragonmaw
#   Thaumaturgist), a Highland Lurker, and the Relic Guardian, who dropped
#   the Titan Relic.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   26 to 33).

step Borstan
  tip In Orgrimmar.
  accept 95697

step Zaruk
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip At Hammerfall.
  accept 95663

step Deathstalker Agent
  zone Wetlands
  tip In the hills above the Dragonmaw camp, close to the dungeon's door.
  turnin 95663
  accept 95682

step To the Excavation Site
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 26 to 33.
  enter "Excavation Site: Wetlands" @47.8,56.2

step Shadetooth and the raptors
  tip Saltspine comes first. Past him, the Thicket Hunters and Lurkers drop the raptor meat, and so does Shadetooth.
  collect 271100 x4 quest 95697.1 @47.8,56.2 group 5

step The Dragonmaw
  tip The Dragonmaw hold the next part of the site. A Dragonmaw Thaumaturgist drops the Dispatch.
  kill 275045 x2 quest 95682.1 @47.8,56.2 group 5
  kill 275044 x4 quest 95682.2 @47.8,56.2 group 5
  collect 284844 quest 95682.3 @47.8,56.2 group 5

step Relic Guardian
  tip The last boss. He drops a Titan Relic, which starts a quest for Thunder Bluff.
  collect 270866 @47.8,56.2 group 5
  accept 95664 @47.8,56.2

step Deathstalker Agent
  turnin 95682

step Borstan
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 95697

step Bashana Runetotem
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip On the Elder Rise.
  turnin 95664
  accept 98823

step Muln Earthfury
  zone Mulgore
  turnin 98823
